<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<Defs>

  <!--
    The automated fabrication bay: VFE Factory's automated machining bay (Name added by
    Patches/MachiningBay.xml) with its own bills. Everything not set here is inherited: size, input cells
    (0,0,3), (-3,0,0), (3,0,0), output at the interaction cell, power, heat, overclocking, boosters and
    heatsinks, piped chemfuel with Vanilla Chemfuel Expanded, and the machining bay's graphics. So it looks
    exactly like the machining bay until it has art of its own. It also inherits the machining bay's two
    hand-written bills (shred mechanoid, shred drone).

    Its other bills are generated at load from the Phobos.Factory.BenchBillTemplateDefs that name it
    (Defs/BenchBillTemplateDefs). Owner's choice, 29 Oct 2026: a separate building for the fabrication bench,
    bioferrite shaper and Rimatomics machining table bills. Cost, work and research are agent defaults, owner
    to tune: more than the machining bay (440 steel, 18 components, 5 advanced components, 5000 work) for
    spacer-grade work, and gated by Fabrication like the fabrication bench.
  -->
  <ThingDef ParentName="PhobosFactory_AutomatedMachiningBayParent">
    <defName>PhobosFactory_AutomatedFabricationBay</defName>
    <label>automated fabrication bay</label>
    <description>An automated facility for precision fabrication. It makes what a fabrication bench makes, from bionic and other artificial body parts to spacer weapons and armour, and with Anomaly or Dubs Rimatomics also the work of a bioferrite shaper or a Rimatomics machining table. Everything comes out at normal quality.\n\nLike every factory building, it takes its materials from factory hoppers on its input cells and puts its work into a factory hopper on its output cell. It gives off heat, draws a lot of power, can be overclocked, and must stand on factory floor.</description>
    <costList Inherit="False">
      <Steel>300</Steel>
      <Plasteel>150</Plasteel>
      <ComponentIndustrial>12</ComponentIndustrial>
      <ComponentSpacer>10</ComponentSpacer>
    </costList>
    <statBases>
      <WorkToBuild>7000</WorkToBuild>
    </statBases>
    <researchPrerequisites Inherit="False">
      <li>VFE_ComplexFactories</li>
      <li>Fabrication</li>
    </researchPrerequisites>
    <building>
      <relatedBuildCommands>
        <li>PhobosFactory_DeepFactoryHopper</li>
      </relatedBuildCommands>
    </building>
  </ThingDef>

</Defs>
